. About 350 words. Let's draft around 350. Need count. Let's write with placeholders: [Date], [Vendor Contact Name], [Vendor Company Name], [Your Name], [Your Company Name]? Company name is a name. Maybe [Your Company Name] is placeholder for name. But user says from a small software company; could use [Company Name]. Need only names and dates placeholders. So no [GPU Model], [Program Name]. Use \"your upcoming GPU\" and \"developer program\".\n\nNeed ensure word count about 350. Let's draft and count.\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name], a small software company that develops an open-source inference engine for deploying machine learning models on heterogeneous hardware. Our engine is designed to provide a lightweight, portable runtime for inference workloads, with particular attention to performance, memory efficiency, and ease of integration for developers who build applications on emerging accelerators.\n\nWe are requesting early access to your developer program for your upcoming GPU. Early access is important to us because our roadmap includes first-class support for your hardware before public launch. To deliver a reliable experience, we need time to understand the device architecture, validate driver and runtime behavior, optimize kernels and memory paths, and identify compatibility issues while they can still be addressed efficiently. Because our project is open source", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0018714882899075747], [1421, -7.130136966705322]], [[1144, -1.2040211004205048e-05], [1902, -11.900818824768066]], [[310, -0.40487444400787354], [4087, -1.1958423852920532]], [[5707, -0.7576830983161926], [4087, -1.0828211307525635]], [[310, -6.6757424974639434e-06], [303, -12.51018238067627]], [[1156, -2.2649790025752736e-06], [6163, -14.000131607055664]], [[25, -0.01042150892317295], [9859, -5.302077770233154]], [[328, -0.059769775718450546], [9357, -3.0376503467559814]], [[7734, -3.5048145946348086e-05], [2523, -10.922064781188965